OL,3,GNEWSAPolice block Orange Order from
OL,4,Acontroversial parade route
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe police prevented the Orange Order
OL,7,Ffrom making a controversial parade down
OL,8,Fa road which had previously been
OL,9,Fblocked by protesters.
OL,11,FA group of men tried to march from
OL,12,FDrumcree Church down the
OL,13,Fmainly-nationalist Garvaghy Road in
OL,14,FPortadown in the early hours of Monday
OL,15,Fbut a line of police Land Rovers stood
OL,16,Fin the way.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
